218
00:08:37,035 --> 00:08:38,877
twenty twenty-six.

219
00:08:39,067 --> 00:08:40,251
In other words,

220
00:08:40,251 --> 00:08:41,676
the tap is open,

221
00:08:41,676 --> 00:08:43,968
