222
00:08:44,217 --> 00:08:47,397
Let me draw three kinds of chokepoints.

223
00:08:47,537 --> 00:08:48,702
The first is skill:

224
00:08:48,702 --> 00:08:51,389
Japan makes resist that others cannot yet

225
00:08:51,389 --> 00:08:52,437
copy.

226
00:08:52,767 --> 00:08:54,697
The second is accident:

227
00:08:54,697 --> 00:08:57,050
