257
00:10:02,621 --> 00:10:03,720
resist.

258
00:10:03,984 --> 00:10:06,913
That next generation is called metal oxide

259
00:10:06,913 --> 00:10:07,884
resist.

260
00:10:07,884 --> 00:10:10,268
Instead of plastic-like molecules,

261
00:10:10,268 --> 00:10:11,777
it uses tin oxide,

262
00:10:11,777 --> 00:10:12,192
which,

263
00:10:12,192 --> 00:10:13,701
according to Inpria,

264
00:10:13,701 --> 00:10:16,107
absorbs extreme ultraviolet light about

265
00:10:16,107 --> 00:10:18,894
roughly five times more efficiently.

266
00:10:19,274 --> 00:10:21,159
JSR is now ramping the world's first

267
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:23,492
