269
00:10:25,194 --> 00:10:27,352
Japan is not only defending today's

270
00:10:27,352 --> 00:10:28,304
recipe.

271
00:10:28,304 --> 00:10:30,427
It is buying tomorrow's.

272
00:10:30,684 --> 00:10:33,141
And the materials are moving closer to

273
00:10:33,141 --> 00:10:34,634
