274
00:10:34,654 --> 00:10:36,327
At the request of TSMC,

275
00:10:36,327 --> 00:10:38,752
JSR is building its first photoresist

276
00:10:38,752 --> 00:10:39,940
plant in Taiwan,

277
00:10:39,940 --> 00:10:42,849
expected to open as early as twenty

278
00:10:42,849 --> 00:10:43,934
twenty-eight.

279
00:10:44,034 --> 00:10:47,213
Its rivals Tokyo Ohka Kogyo and Shin-Etsu

280
00:10:47,213 --> 00:10:50,014
