281
00:10:50,104 --> 00:10:52,234
The reason is speed.

282
00:10:52,314 --> 00:10:55,540
Every new chip generation needs hundreds

283
00:10:55,540 --> 00:10:56,858
of test cycles,

284
00:10:56,858 --> 00:10:59,547
and shipping samples across the sea for

285
00:10:59,547 --> 00:11:01,222
